{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900501680701530"], "id": "2099900501680701530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6651, "impression_count": 692605, "like_count": 6823, "quote_count": 258, "reply_count": 176, "retweet_count": 1590}, "text": "Lots of people discuss immigration &amp; crime in Europe, so I compiled what I think is ALL the data on the topic, which is hard because many countries hide it.\nDo they commit more crime?\nIs it because of age? Sex? Education? Poverty? Culture?\n\n1. Sexual offenses &amp; violent crime: https://t.co/EhM15S4O5U", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900507825299551"], "id": "2099900507825299551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 109, "impression_count": 49706, "like_count": 884, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 83}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900504868343963", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "As you can see, many of the top crime origin countries are Muslim, but there can be a confounding factor here, as many Muslim countries are poor &amp; education is low\n\nSo I looked into this, and immigrants from Muslim countries commit ~50% more crime than from non-Muslim ones https://t.co/VPFx8xpKju", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900504868343963"], "id": "2099900504868343963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 154, "impression_count": 54190, "like_count": 1048, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 109}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900501680701530", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "2. GERMANY\nHere, Algerians get the record, with one crime for every 3 Algerians every year https://t.co/UTtS8MMsd6", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900510820024824"], "id": "2099900510820024824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 80, "impression_count": 45109, "like_count": 759, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 74}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900507825299551", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "3. DENMARK\nSimilar pattern. Here, for violent crime.\nMENAPT means Middle East, North Africa, Pakistan, and Turkey. Why that is a statistical region, I'll leave to the reader https://t.co/jxz61xDLxf", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900514313887808"], "id": "2099900514313887808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 125, "impression_count": 43030, "like_count": 828, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 74}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900510820024824", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Common counterargument: \"Yeah but a majority of immigrants are young men. Youth &amp; men commit more crime than the average\"\n\nOf course, that means maybe Europe should take that into consideration when accepting immigrants. But even then, if you control for these, you get this: https://t.co/Pvtbuxf6eo", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900518646595900"], "id": "2099900518646595900", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 83, "impression_count": 36867, "like_count": 699, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 66}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900514313887808", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "You might want the breakdown per type of crime, so here it is. In Denmark, the top immigrants in terms of crime are Somalians, who are 10-30x more criminal than the average Dane. Meaning for every crime a Dane commits, a Somalian commits 10 to 30 crimes https://t.co/C2vrfE6TGv", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900522220146796"], "id": "2099900522220146796", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 60, "impression_count": 34666, "like_count": 640, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 44}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900518646595900", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Another common counterargument: \"Immigrants get profiled more by the police!\"\n\nIf this were true, we should see lots of arrests but few convictions\u27a1\ufe0flow conviction rate.\n\nWe see the opposite: immigrants tend to be convicted at a much higher rate https://t.co/AgGCjVKgdW", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900528469643450"], "id": "2099900528469643450", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 43, "impression_count": 29115, "like_count": 418, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 23}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900525223305486", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "5. SPAIN\nIt's an interesting one because northern European countries tend to attract Muslim immigration, whereas Spain has Muslim, Latin American, and European immigration. https://t.co/Wtd2OXsYt7", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900525223305486"], "id": "2099900525223305486", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 42, "impression_count": 30698, "like_count": 477, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 27}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900522220146796", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "4. SWEDEN\nData is sparser here, but we still see a similar pattern https://t.co/AnFs1cEp5j", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900531606986915"], "id": "2099900531606986915", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 28004, "like_count": 415, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 19}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900528469643450", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "So how does crime rate compare per country of origin? Spain doesn't share this data, but we have something else: https://t.co/CMfHZNasnI", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900534547227115"], "id": "2099900534547227115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 27002, "like_count": 436, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 33}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900531606986915", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "6. FINLAND https://t.co/bmRK7dHIoP", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900538888311242"], "id": "2099900538888311242", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 25076, "like_count": 389, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 26}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900534547227115", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "7. ITALY https://t.co/kmNdyaFkOk", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900545334997114"], "id": "2099900545334997114", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 36, "impression_count": 24033, "like_count": 421, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 41}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900542344368548", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "9. UK\nIt doesn't share data at the national level, but we have some on sex offenses for London: https://t.co/ULYY2hK4A9", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900542344368548"], "id": "2099900542344368548", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 40, "impression_count": 24493, "like_count": 390, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 23}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900538888311242", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "8. NORWAY https://t.co/sB0RRPRMV5", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:37:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900549340549507"], "id": "2099900549340549507", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 23444, "like_count": 393, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 31}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900545334997114", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "And we have arrests in England and Wales: https://t.co/UxouSHXeJk", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:38:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900552175882246"], "id": "2099900552175882246", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 22590, "like_count": 462, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 26}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900549340549507", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "When you get deep into the data, you realize a few things that resolve most debates:\n1. In fact, in a lot of countries, overall crime rates are down! But it's because the native population gets older (so less crime), compensated by the influx of immigrants, who commit more crime", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:38:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900557464945106"], "id": "2099900557464945106", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 20643, "like_count": 386, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 21}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900555019665772", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "3. It's true that the higher crime rate of immigrants is in part due to age, sex, economics &amp; education. But even controlling for those, European immigrants commit much more crime than natives", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:38:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900555019665772"], "id": "2099900555019665772", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 74, "impression_count": 23445, "like_count": 538, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 55}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900552175882246", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "2. Immigrants don't commit more of all crimes. They specialize in sex crimes &amp; violent assaults\n\nBut these are rare crimes compared to, say, pickpocketing\n\nThe result is that total crime stats (made disproportionately of petty crimes) can seem stable, while violent crime grows https://t.co/lQGjiKvvO8", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:38:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900561663443190"], "id": "2099900561663443190", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 20084, "like_count": 385, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 24}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900559570391384", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "But not all immigration is bad:\n\u2022 The majority of immigrants don't commit crimes\n\u2022 Many countries provide low-crime immigrants\n\u2022 Including from Muslim countries: eg, Malaysia, Indonesia\n\u2022 A good immigrant can come from anywhere. The EU must be able to tell good vs bad ones", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:38:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900559570391384"], "id": "2099900559570391384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 20630, "like_count": 533, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 21}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900557464945106", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "4. A pretty big tell is that most European countries don't publish all the relevant data\u2014they know that, if they did, the truth would be inconvenient.", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:38:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900565241082301"], "id": "2099900565241082301", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 122, "impression_count": 25260, "like_count": 446, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 22}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900563513086288", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Tomorrow I'll post the same data, but on the economics of immigrants in Europe: What is their contribution?\nFollowto get it: @tomaspueyo \n\nSources and details for this thread here:\nhttps://t.co/HV7KpL3vpP\n(you can subscribe for free)", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:38:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099900563513086288"], "id": "2099900563513086288", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 22974, "like_count": 455, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 23}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099900561663443190", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Yet at the same time, it is unequivocal that immigrants in Europe cause a lot more crime than natives, which changes the behavior in the country. European countries must be much more selective about their immigrants, and eject the criminals more effectively.", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
{"author_id": "22346932", "conversation_id": "2099900501680701530", "created_at": "2026-09-15T16:58:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2099905796154777765"], "id": "2099905796154777765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4838, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099902225904451928", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@flounder_MA Interesting hypothesis.\nNo country still has leaded gasoline. Algeria was the last country to ban it, in 2021. But it's true that a few countries kept it until recently\nEg 2013 below:\nBut MENAPT bans only trailed European ones by ~5y https://t.co/vWVo0eEdsI", "username": "tomaspueyo", "author_followers": 332526}
